name: ['Abeyance', 'Adarkar Wastes', "All Hallow's Eve", 'Autumn Willow', 'Balance', 'Balduvian Horde', 'Baron Sengir', 'Black Knight', 'Blacker Lotus', 'Blinking Spirit', 'Brushland', 'Cadaverous Bloom', 'City of Brass', 'Crimson Hellkite', 'Cursed Scroll', 'Dark Banishing', 'Deflection', 'Disenchant', 'Dissipate', 'Drain Life', 'Earthquake', 'Enduring Renewal', 'Erhnam Djinn', 'Fallen Angel', 'Fireball', 'Force of Nature', 'Forest', 'Greater Realm of Preservation', 'Guardian Beast', 'Hurricane', 'Hydroblast', 'Icy Manipulator', 'Incinerate', 'Infernal Contract', 'Infernal Spawn of Evil', 'Island', 'Ivory Tower', 'Jokulhaups', 'Karplusan Forest', 'Lhurgoyf', 'Library of Alexandria', 'Meditate', 'Mirror Mirror', 'Mirror Universe', 'Mountain', 'Natural Balance', 'Necropotence', 'Nether Shadow', 'Order of the White Shield', 'Personal Incarnation', 'Plains', 'Pox', 'Prosperity', 'Pyroblast', 'Pyroclasm', 'Recall', 'Shatterstorm', 'Sibilant Spirit', "Sol'kanar the Swamp King", 'Squandered Resources', 'Squirrel Farm', 'Stormbind', 'Swamp', 'Swords to Plowshares', 'Vampiric Tutor', 'Vesuvan Doppelganger', 'Wheel of Fortune', 'Zuran Orb']
